      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5ac0434458926eba",
      "translationZh": "修复了一个 Code 元素包含无法解析的差异时，插件面板显示为空的问题；现在将其绘制为纯代码",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a8c1d709a272e630",
