      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b47660b2ddfbfc6c",
      "translationZh": "修复了插件 tool.call 钩子导致 Bash 失败，以及在工作树中运行的子代理中文件搜索读取错误文件夹的问题",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e1b76b3059c01673",
      "translationZh": "修复了在较旧的 git（2.39 之前，例如 Ubuntu 22.04 的 2.34）上，git-subdir 插件安装失败或缓存不完整插件的问题",
